{"seq":2,"slug":"multiprocessing-shared-memory","title":"多进程、共享内存与进程间传输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-performance-optimization/architecture-level/multiprocessing-shared-memory","wordCount":2209,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"多进程-共享内存与进程间传输\">多进程、共享内存与进程间传输</h1><p><code>ProcessPoolExecutor</code> 常常让人失望：8 核机器上开了 8 个进程，总耗时只降了 1.5 倍。原因几乎总在同一个地方——传输成本吃掉了并行收益。每提交一个任务要把参数序列化、通过管道送给子进程、子进程反序列化、计算、再把结果序列化送回来。当任务本身只有几毫秒、而参数是几十 MB 的数组时，序列化往返远大于计算。本章讲清这批成本的具体来源与把它降到接近零的手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多进程并行的收益公式可以粗略写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\frac{T_{calc}}{T_{calc}/N + T_{comm} + T_{start}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{calc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单进程计算时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是进程数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{comm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每次任务的通信往返，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{start}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是进程启动摊销。要接近线性加速，必须让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{comm} + T_{start}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{calc}/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。优化工作全部集中在这两项上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[主进程 提交任务] --&gt; B{传输方式}&#10;    B --&gt;|pickle 管道| C[序列化参数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[写入管道 / socket]&#10;    D --&gt; E[子进程反序列化]&#10;    E --&gt; F[计算]&#10;    F --&gt; G[序列化结果]&#10;    G --&gt; H[回传 + 反序列化]&#10;    B --&gt;|共享内存 forked| I[子进程直接可见只读数据]&#10;    I --&gt; F&#10;    B --&gt;|共享内存 SharedMemory| J[按名称映射同一块缓冲区]&#10;    J --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[主进程 提交任务] --&gt; B{传输方式}\n    B --&gt;|pickle 管道| C[序列化参数]\n    C --&gt; D[写入管道 / socket]\n    D --&gt; E[子进程反序列化]\n    E --&gt; F[计算]\n    F --&gt; G[序列化结果]\n    G --&gt; H[回传 + 反序列化]\n    B --&gt;|共享内存 forked| I[子进程直接可见只读数据]\n    I --&gt; F\n    B --&gt;|共享内存 SharedMemory| J[按名称映射同一块缓冲区]\n    J --&gt; F</pre><p>四种传输方式的成本对照（以 100MB 浮点数组为参照量级）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>传输成本</th>\n<th>内存峰值</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>pickle</code> 管道（默认）</td>\n<td>高（序列化 + 至少一次拷贝）</td>\n<td>高（两端各一份）</td>\n<td>小对象、任务数少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fork</code> 继承（Linux）</td>\n<td>零拷贝（写时复制）</td>\n<td>低（共享页）</td>\n<td>只读大输入、Linux only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>multiprocessing.shared_memory</code></td>\n<td>极低（映射后直接访问）</td>\n<td>低（一块缓冲区）</td>\n<td>大数组、频繁传参</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>numpy.memmap</code></td>\n<td>极低（按需换页）</td>\n<td>低（可超出物理内存）</td>\n<td>超大数据、随机访问</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>一个关键区分</strong>：<code>fork</code> 继承是「子进程看得见父进程在 fork 时已存在的对象」，它不需要显式传输，但<strong>只对只读数据安全</strong>——写入会触发写时复制，产生额外的内存开销，且修改不会反映到父进程。而 <code>shared_memory</code> 是一块显式命名的共享缓冲区，父子双方都能读写，需要自行同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"启动方式-fork-spawn-与-forkserver\">启动方式：fork、spawn 与 forkserver</h2><p><code>multiprocessing</code> 有三种启动方式，选择直接决定启动成本与正确性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>启动方式</th>\n<th>平台默认</th>\n<th>启动成本</th>\n<th>内存共享</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>fork</code></td>\n<td>Linux（3.14 前）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>写时复制，共享已有对象</td>\n<td>与线程/GIL 状态混用时可能死锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>spawn</code></td>\n<td>Windows、macOS</td>\n<td>高（重新导入模块）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>全局状态不继承，<code>__main__</code> 必须守卫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>forkserver</code></td>\n<td>无（可显式选）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>状态比 fork 干净，比 spawn 快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意的是 Python 3.14 在 Linux 上的变化：CPython 把默认启动方式从 <code>fork</code> 调整为 <code>forkserver</code>（通过 <code>multiprocessing.get_context()</code> 可显式选择）。原因是 <code>fork</code> 在多线程进程中是不安全的——子进程只会继承调用 fork 的那个线程，但会继承所有锁的状态，包括 <code>logging</code>、<code>importlib</code> 等模块内部的锁。父进程另一个线程若正持有这类锁，子进程会永久死锁。这类死锁在真实项目中并不罕见。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import multiprocessing as mp&#10;&#10;if __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:&#10;    ctx = mp.get_context(&quot;spawn&quot;)&#10;    with ctx.Pool(processes=8) as pool:&#10;        results = pool.map(heavy, chunked_inputs)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> multiprocessing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __name__</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"__main__\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mp.get_context(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"spawn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.Pool(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">processes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool.map(heavy, chunked_inputs)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个实践要点：<strong>其一，<code>spawn</code> 要求目标函数与参数在模块顶层可导入</strong>（不能是局部函数或闭包），所有被传递对象的定义必须在模块级。<strong>其二，<code>if __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:</code> 守卫是必需的</strong>，否则 <code>spawn</code> 会在子进程中重新执行主模块导致无限递归。<strong>其三，选启动方式要考虑「fork 带来的免费内存共享」是否重要</strong>——如果你的主要成本是读取一份大只读数据集，<code>fork</code> 能在 Linux 上免费共享它，而 <code>spawn</code> 会重新加载或在传递时复制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"共享内存与零拷贝传输\">共享内存与零拷贝传输</h2><p><code>multiprocessing.shared_memory</code> 是标准库中的共享内存接口，它在父子进程间提供同一块匿名缓冲区：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from multiprocessing import shared_memory&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def worker(shm_name, shape, dtype, start, end, out_q):&#10;    shm = shared_memory.SharedMemory(name=shm_name)&#10;    arr = np.ndarray(shape, dtype=dtype, buffer=shm.buf)&#10;    out_q.put(float(arr[start:end].sum()))&#10;    shm.close()&#10;&#10;if __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:&#10;    data = np.arange(10_000_000, dtype=np.float64)&#10;    shm = shared_memory.SharedMemory(create=True, size=data.nbytes)&#10;    shared = np.ndarray(data.shape, dtype=data.dtype, buffer=shm.buf)&#10;    shared[:] = data[:]&#10;    ...&#10;    shm.close()&#10;    shm.unlink()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> multiprocessing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shared_memory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(shm_name, shape, dtype, start, end, out_q):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shared_memory.SharedMemory(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shm_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    arr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.ndarray(shape, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dtype, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shm.buf)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    out_q.put(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(arr[start:end].sum()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shm.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __name__</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"__main__\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.arange(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.float64)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shared_memory.SharedMemory(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data.nbytes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shared </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.ndarray(data.shape, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data.dtype, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shm.buf)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shared[:] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data[:]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shm.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shm.unlink()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四个必须遵守的纪律：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，生命周期是显式管理。</strong> <code>create=True</code> 创建、<code>close()</code> 解除映射、<code>unlink()</code> 删除底层段。漏掉 <code>unlink()</code> 会在 <code>/dev/shm</code> 留下残留段（Linux 上表现为 <code>df -h</code> 显示可用内存减少）。创建方负责 unlink，使用者只 close。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，必须自己做同步。</strong> 共享内存本身不提供任何锁或顺序保证。分块处理时要用明确的边界划分（如上例的 <code>start</code>/<code>end</code>），或者配套 <code>Lock</code>/<code>Barrier</code>。<strong>数据竞争在共享内存上不会报错，只会给出错误结果。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>其三，<code>np.ndarray(buffer=shm.buf)</code> 的构造是零拷贝的</strong>，它直接在这块缓冲区上建立数组视图。这是整个机制的价值所在——100MB 的数组不再需要序列化，只需传递一个名字和形状。</p>\n<p><strong>其四，共享内存对「读多写少」最友好。</strong> 如果每个进程都要写自己的结果，用队列回传小的汇总值（如上例只回传一个 float）比共享写入结果区更简单、更不易出错。</p>\n<p>一个替代方案是 <strong><code>np.memmap</code></strong>：它把磁盘文件映射成数组，多个进程映射同一文件即为共享，且<strong>数据可超出物理内存</strong>（按需换页）。代价是依赖文件系统性能，且适合随机访问而非全量扫描。超大数据集分块处理时，<code>memmap</code> 常常比 <code>shared_memory</code> 更省事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行粒度与进程池配置\">并行粒度与进程池配置</h2><p>粒度选择决定了通信成本能否被摊薄。三条规则：</p>\n<p><strong>规则一，任务要足够大。</strong> 单个任务的计算时间应当显著大于一次通信往返。经验阈值是任务计算时间在 10ms 以上（相对于管道通信的百微秒量级），否则应当合并多个小任务为一批。这与 <a href=\"asyncio-throughput\">asyncio 中避免小操作拆细</a> 是同一原则在进程尺度的体现。</p>\n<p><strong>规则二，块大小（chunksize）要调。</strong> <code>Pool.map</code> 的 <code>chunksize</code> 控制每次提交给一个进程的元素数量。太小则通信次数多，太大则负载不均（尾部一个慢块拖住整体）。一个可用的初始值是 <code>len(items) // (processes * 4)</code>，再按负载分布调整。</p>\n<p><strong>规则三，进程数不宜超过物理核数。</strong> 与 <a href=\"../interpreter-model/gil-free-threaded-313\">free-threaded 多线程</a> 的结论一致：超额订阅会带来上下文切换与缓存失效。若任务内含 NumPy 的多线程内核或 Numba 的 <code>prange</code>，进程数应相应减少（总线程数 = 进程数 × 每进程线程数，控制在物理核数以内）。</p>\n<p>进程池的两种接口各有适用：<code>Pool.map</code> 保留输入顺序，适合结果要与输入一一对应的场景；<code>Pool.imap_unordered</code> 按完成顺序返回，适合只关心结果集合、想尽早开始处理的场景，且它对内存更友好（不会先把所有输入都物化）。大数据流式处理时 <code>imap_unordered</code> 通常明显更优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定-什么时候不该多进程\">判定：什么时候不该多进程</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>判断</th>\n<th>替代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单任务计算 &lt; 10ms</td>\n<td>通信成本主导</td>\n<td>增大粒度或改单进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瓶颈是 I/O 等待</td>\n<td>进程不解决等待</td>\n<td><a href=\"asyncio-throughput\">asyncio/线程</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要共享大量可变状态</td>\n<td>同步复杂度爆炸</td>\n<td>free-threaded 多线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据必须频繁双向交换</td>\n<td>通信成本随交换量增长</td>\n<td>重新划分任务边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单机内存已接近上限</td>\n<td>每进程独立内存会翻倍</td>\n<td>共享内存或 memmap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务需要 GPU</td>\n<td>进程与 GPU 上下文交互复杂</td>\n<td>单进程多流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常被忽略的替代路径：<strong>换工具而不是换并行模型</strong>。如果热点是数值计算，NumPy 内部的 BLAS 已经多线程，<code>numpy</code> 的批量调用本身就利用了多核；如果热点是聚合与连接，<code>polars</code> 与 DuckDB 的内部并行通常优于手写多进程。<strong>先确认你用的库是否已经在并行</strong>，再决定是否需要自己管理进程池——重复并行（进程池 × 库内线程）是最常见的负优化。</p>\n<p>排查多进程性能问题的顺序也是固定的：先用 <a href=\"../profiling-tools/cprofile-pyinstrument\">剖析</a> 确认单进程内的热点，再用计时打点区分「计算时间」与「通信时间」（在子进程内记录处理时的墙钟时间并与主进程计时对比），最后才调整并行度与传输方式。跳过第一步的调参往往是在错误的层面对症。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多进程加速由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = T_{calc} / (T_{calc}/N + T_{comm} + T_{start})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定；收益不足时问题通常在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{comm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{start}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不在计算。</li>\n<li>启动方式决定启动成本与安全性：<code>fork</code> 最便宜但多线程下不安全，<code>spawn</code> 最干净但最慢，<code>forkserver</code> 居中；Python 3.14 在 Linux 上把默认从 <code>fork</code> 改为 <code>forkserver</code>。</li>\n<li>传输成本从高到低依次是 pickle 管道、<code>fork</code> 继承（只读零拷贝）、<code>shared_memory</code>、<code>memmap</code>；共享内存需要显式生命周期管理（<code>close</code>/<code>unlink</code>）与自建同步。</li>\n<li>粒度规则：任务计算时间应在 10ms 以上，<code>chunksize</code> 初始取 <code>len/(processes*4)</code>，进程数不超过物理核数并与库内线程数一起纳入预算。</li>\n<li>六种不该多进程的情况（任务过小、I/O 瓶颈、大量可变共享状态、频繁双向交换、内存接近上限、GPU 任务）；先确认所用库是否已在内部并行，避免重复并行。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多进程、共享内存与进程间传输","id":"多进程-共享内存与进程间传输"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"启动方式：fork、spawn 与 forkserver","id":"启动方式-fork-spawn-与-forkserver"},{"level":2,"text":"共享内存与零拷贝传输","id":"共享内存与零拷贝传输"},{"level":2,"text":"并行粒度与进程池配置","id":"并行粒度与进程池配置"},{"level":2,"text":"判定：什么时候不该多进程","id":"判定-什么时候不该多进程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"asyncio 吞吐与阻塞调用排查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-performance-optimization/architecture-level/asyncio-throughput"},"next":{"title":"缓存、惰性求值与流式数据管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-performance-optimization/architecture-level/caching-streaming-pipelines"}}